.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/

# Heavy data — never ship to Cloud Run (with surgical re-includes below).
# pipeline/ + control/ + scripts/ + web/ are intentionally INCLUDED in
# the build context here because the FastAPI image's Dockerfile COPYs
# them. (`data/*` rather than `data/` so the !exceptions further down
# can re-include the small mirrored-asset subdirs.)
data/*
workers/
sources/
agent/
shared/
tests/
docs/

# Re-include the mirrored channel-asset + cached-YouTube + analytics
# subdirs (~2 MB total) so /api/channels surfaces real avatars, banners,
# subscriber/view stats. cloud/web-server/Dockerfile COPYs each of these
# explicitly. data/* (with wildcard) above keeps the parent dir visible
# so these re-includes work — gitignore semantics forbid re-including
# children of an excluded dir.
!data/research/
data/research/*
!data/research/channel_assets/
!data/research/channel_assets/**
!data/research/youtube/
!data/research/youtube/**
!data/research/analytics/
!data/research/analytics/**

# Per-channel folders: cloud control plane needs config.yaml + variants/
# + uploads/ + raw/ + narrations/ (the last two so the round-robin
# scheduler can see the backlog). Everything heavy stays out.
**/cache/
**/scratch/
**/footage/
**/emoji/
**/cooking_loops/
**/tts_tests/
**/cooking_bg_queue.yaml
**/branding/
**/shorts/
**/learnings/
**/cast/
**/prompts/
**/dossier/
**/shotlist/
**/specs/
**/critiques/
**/songs/
*/scripts/
*/SHIPPED.md

# Models
*.onnx
*.bin
*.safetensors

# Old docs
*.md
!README.md
